{
  "job_B21.1.1.3_20251003_114533": {
    "chunk_text": "beo\u00f0 on mannes handum o\u00f0\u00f0e on o\u00ferum limum o\u00f0\u00f0e ymb \u00feone utgang Hra\u00fee heo hy onweg afyrre\u00f0. Wi\u00f0 wundspringum & anwlatan, rammes lungen smel tocorfen & to \u00feam sare geled, sona hyt geh\u00e6l\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 scurfum, rammes smeoru, & meng \u00f0\u00e6rto sot & sealt & sand, & hyt wulla onweg & \u00e6fter smyre. Hyt by\u00fe eft li\u00f0re. Wi\u00f0 \u00e6lc sar, bares br\u00e6gen gesoden & to drence geworht on wine, ealle sar hyt geli\u00f0ega\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 h\u00e6r\u00feena sare & teorses, bares br\u00e6gen meng wi\u00f0 hunig & wri\u00f0 on, wundorlice hyt h\u00e6le\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 n\u00e6dran bite, bares br\u00e6gen gesoden & gemencged wi\u00f0 hunig, wundorlice hyt geh\u00e6le\u00fe. Eft wi\u00f0 sarum & gewundedum fotum, bares lungen gebeaten swi\u00f0e smale & wi\u00f0 hunig gemenged & to Hra\u00fee heo \u00fe\u00e6t sar geh\u00e6le\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 inno\u00f0es flewsan, niwe bares lifre wyrc to drence on wine & \u00feonne drince. Sona him bi\u00f0 sel. Oras onweg to adonne, nim bares lifre & swetre apuldre rinde, wyl tosomne on wine gemenged & Hra\u00f0e hy fleo\u00f0 onweg fram him. Gif earan syn innan sare & \u00fe\u00e6r wyrms sy, on do \u00fea ylcan sealfe. Heo ys swy\u00fee god to \u00feam. Weres wylla to gefremmanne, nime bares geallan & smyre mid \u00feone teors & \u00fea h\u00e6r\u00fean. \u00deonne hafa\u00f0 he mycelne lust. Wi\u00f0 fylleseocum men,",
